 wa eneo','For example fr_FR'=>'Kwa mfano fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Jina (si lazima)','For example Français'=>'Kwa mfano Français','Add language'=>'Ongeza lugha','Front-end output'=>'Matokeo ya mbele','Class name prefix'=>'Kiapo cha jina la darasa','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kila jina la darasa ambalo programu-jalizi huchapisha kwenye kurasa zako huanza na kiambishi hiki, ili kurasa zisifichue ni programu-jalizi gani iliyozijenga. Herufi ndogo au nambari 1 hadi 8, zikianza na herufi.','Beta updates'=>'Sasisho za Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Tovuti hii inapokea matoleo ya majaribio kama masasisho.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Tovuti hii inapokea matoleo thabiti pekee.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Badilisha hii kwenye ukurasa wa Akaunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Matoleo ya Beta hutolewa kwa usakinishaji wa Pro wenye leseni ambao umeunganishwa na akaunti yao. Ukishaunganishwa, unaweza kujiunga kutoka kwenye ukurasa wa Akaunti.','Save settings'=>'Hifadhi mipangilio','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ongeza lugha ya pili chini ya Tranzly katika menyu ya msimamizi, na kiteuzi kitaonekana hapa.','Switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji','Accessible label'=>'Lebo inayoweza kufikiwa','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji cha lugha','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Viungo vya ukurasa huu katika kila lugha ya tovuti. Haionyeshi chochote hadi lugha mbili au zaidi ziorodheshwe.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Lugha','block keywordswitcher'=>'kichochezi','block keywordtranslation'=>'tafsiri']];